	(text "LIST OF CONNECTORS:\n\nISP: 10 pin IDC connector\n\nThe big connectors:\nMolex, series number 35313; in 3 and 5 pin variant.\n(Note that this series seems to about to be discontinued,\nMolex doesn't list the 5 pin variant on their website, however Mouser has few left)\n\nThe small connectors:\nMolex, series number 35312; in 5, 6 and 7 pin variant.\n(Note that this series seems to be discontinued)\n\nPower connectors:\nMini-fit 1x2\nMini-fit 2x2\n(I Can't seem to find like a proper name for them. But I linked the ones I bought\nthat fit)"
